{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PCg2znaxAgJn3Lp4RyWbSW","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"gold-set\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"650 窗口人工标注（3 annotators, majority vote），评估所有方法在 ground-truth 上的真实性能\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"gold_n_windows\": 650,\n7\t      \"annotator_count\": 3,\n8\t      \"gold_kappa_fleiss\": 0.82,\n9\t      \"gold_kappa_pairwise_mean\": 0.83,\n10\t      \"gold_mv_agreement_rate\": 0.92,\n11\t      \"gold_stag_ratio\": 0.29,\n12\t      \"disagreement_windows\": 52,\n13\t      \"structural_rf_gold_macro_f1\": 0.9438,\n14\t      \"structural_rf_gold_f1_stag\": 0.9187,\n15\t      \"structural_rf_gold_f1_prog\": 0.9689,\n16\t      \"structural_gb_gold_macro_f1\": 0.9485,\n17\t      \"structural_gb_gold_f1_stag\": 0.9253,\n18\t      \"structural_gb_gold_f1_prog\": 0.9717,\n19\t      \"probe_gold_macro_f1\": 0.8612,\n20\t      \"probe_gold_f1_stag\": 0.8034,\n21\t      \"probe_gold_f1_prog\": 0.919,\n22\t      \"structural_gb_minus_probe_gold_pp\": 8.73,\n23\t      \"llm_judge_zeroshot_gold_macro_f1\": 0.6891,\n24\t      \"llm_judge_zeroshot_gold_f1_stag\": 0.6203,\n25\t      \"llm_judge_zeroshot_gold_f1_prog\": 0.7579,\n26\t      \"twv_probe_gold_macro_f1\": 0.8549,\n27\t      \"structural_gb_vs_llm_gold_pp\": 25.94,\n28\t      \"probe_vs_llm_gold_pp\": 17.21,\n29\t      \"gold_disagree_mv_n\": 52,\n30\t      \"gold_disagree_mv_probe_correct_pct\": 0.38,\n31\t      \"gold_disagree_mv_structural_correct_pct\": 0.56,\n32\t      \"structural_gb_gold_ci95_low\": 0.9301,\n33\t      \"structural_gb_gold_ci95_high\": 0.9652,\n34\t      \"probe_gold_ci95_low\": 0.8329,\n35\t      \"probe_gold_ci95_high\": 0.8871\n36\t    },\n37\t    \"tables\": [\n38\t      {\n39\t        \"name\": \"Table: Gold-Validated Method Comparison (N=650)\",\n40\t        \"columns\": [\n41\t          \"Method\",\n42\t          \"Gold Macro-F1\",\n43\t          \"Gold F1-stag\",\n44\t          \"Gold F1-prog\",\n45\t          \"LF-eval F1\",\n46\t          \"Δ(Gold-LF)\"\n47\t        ],\n48\t        \"rows\": [\n49\t          [\n50\t            \"Structural GB\",\n51\t            \"0.9485\",\n52\t            \"0.9253\",\n53\t            \"0.9717\",\n54\t            \"0.9951\",\n55\t            \"-4.66pp\"\n56\t          ],\n57\t          [\n58\t            \"Structural RF\",\n59\t            \"0.9438\",\n60\t            \"0.9187\",\n61\t            \"0.9689\",\n62\t            \"0.9951\",\n63\t            \"-5.13pp\"\n64\t          ],\n65\t          [\n66\t            \"GRU Probe (Qwen3)\",\n67\t            \"0.8612\",\n68\t            \"0.8034\",\n69\t            \"0.9190\",\n70\t            \"0.9055\",\n71\t            \"-4.43pp\"\n72\t          ],\n73\t          [\n74\t            \"LLM-judge (zero-shot)\",\n75\t            \"0.6891\",\n76\t            \"0.6203\",\n77\t            \"0.7579\",\n78\t            \"0.6625\",\n79\t            \"+2.66pp\"\n80\t          ],\n81\t          [\n82\t            \"TWV Probe\",\n83\t            \"0.8549\",\n84\t            \"0.7941\",\n85\t            \"0.9157\",\n86\t            \"0.9003†\",\n87\t            \"-4.54pp\"\n88\t          ]\n89\t        ]\n90\t      },\n91\t      {\n92\t        \"name\": \"Table: Inter-Annotator Agreement\",\n93\t        \"columns\": [\n94\t          \"Metric\",\n95\t          \"Value\"\n96\t        ],\n97\t        \"rows\": [\n98\t          [\n99\t            \"Fleiss' κ (3 annotators)\",\n100\t            \"0.82\"\n101\t          ],\n102\t          [\n103\t            \"Mean pairwise Cohen's κ\",\n104\t            \"0.83\"\n105\t          ],\n106\t          [\n107\t            \"Gold-MV agreement rate\",\n108\t            \"92.0%\"\n109\t          ],\n110\t          [\n111\t            \"Disagreement windows\",\n112\t            \"52/650 (8.0%)\"\n113\t          ],\n114\t          [\n115\t            \"Gold stag prevalence\",\n116\t            \"29.1%\"\n117\t          ]\n118\t        ]\n119\t      }\n120\t    ],\n121\t    \"figures\": [],\n122\t    \"analysis\": \"Gold validation 是论文从 'interesting but circular' 升级到 'validated practical guidance' 的关键。8.7pp structural-probe gap 在 gold 上保持，证明 zero-shot dominance 不是 circular artifact。论文可以用 gold F1 作为 headline number（0.948 vs LF-eval 的 0.995），虽然绝对值 略低但 ground-truth validated，reviewer 无法再 dismiss 为 circular。Circular evaluation concern 通过一组数据彻底关闭：(1) structural gold F1 仅降 4.7pp 说明绝大部分信号是真实的； (2) 即使在 gold-MV disagreement 的困难样本上 structural 仍优于 probe；(3) κ=0.82 证明 stagnation 本身是可靠标注的概念。\\n\\n\\nBest 档假设 Gold 标注高度验证 MV 标签质量。κ=0.82 表明 annotators 在 stagnation 判断上有 substantial agreement（SE 任务的 progress/stagnation 边界本身有主观性，但 window-level 5-step 序列给了足够上下文让标注者达成一致）。92% gold-MV agreement 意味着 MV pipeline 在绝大多数窗口上产出了正确标签——8% 的 disagreement 集中在 conf=1 的边界案例。\\nStructural features 在 gold 上的 F1 从 LF-eval 的 0.9951 降至 ~0.948，降幅 ~4.7pp， 这正是预期的：(1) structural features 部分通过 LF 输入特征逆向工程 LF 标签，失去这层 circular boost 后性能下降；(2) 但降幅很小，说明 structural features 确实捕获了真实 stagnation 信号——不仅仅是 LF 逻辑的映射。0.948 在 650 个 ground-truth 窗口上仍然是 近乎完美的检测能力。\\nProbe 在 gold 上的 F1=0.861 vs LF-eval 的 0.906 降 ~4.5pp，降幅类似。Probe 学到的 不完全是 LF 启发式，而是部分学到了真实语义信号。但 structural 仍领先 probe 8.7pp， 证明 zero-shot dominance 在 ground truth 上成立。\\nLLM-judge 在 gold 上 0.689 vs LF-eval 的 0.663 微升 2.6pp——LLM 不受 circular eval 影响（本来就是独立评估），gold 标签略偏向 LLM 的语义判断，合理。但仍远低于 structural 和 probe，效率差距在 ground truth 上得到验证。\\nGold 与 MV disagreement 的 52 个窗口中 structural 有 56% 正确率（高于 probe 的 38%）， 进一步支持 structural features 检测的是真实停滞而非仅仅拟合 LF 规则。\\n\"\n123\t  },\n124\t  {\n125\t    \"name\": \"llm-judge-fewshot\",\n126\t    \"description\": \"LLM-as-judge 加入 5-shot exemplars + chain-of-thought prompting，在 gold set 650 窗口上评估\",\n127\t    \"results\": {\n128\t      \"model\": \"claude-sonnet-4-6\",\n129\t      \"mode\": \"5-shot + CoT\",\n130\t      \"n_windows\": 650,\n131\t      \"gold_macro_f1\": 0.7234,\n132\t      \"gold_f1_stag\": 0.6712,\n133\t      \"gold_f1_prog\": 0.7756,\n134\t      \"gold_accuracy\": 0.7369,\n135\t      \"gold_precision_macro\": 0.7518,\n136\t      \"gold_recall_macro\": 0.7102,\n137\t      \"delta_vs_zeroshot_pp\": 3.43,\n138\t      \"structural_gb_advantage_pp\": 22.51,\n139\t      \"probe_advantage_pp\": 13.78,\n140\t      \"api_cost_usd\": 18.92,\n141\t      \"total_tokens\": 4812000,\n142\t      \"avg_latency_ms\": 3200,\n143\t      \"stag_recall\": 0.6389,\n144\t      \"stag_precision\": 0.7081,\n145\t      \"common_FN_pattern\": \"diverse-action stagnation where steps look productive in isolation\",\n146\t      \"common_FP_pattern\": \"repetitive but effective debugging loops\"\n147\t    },\n148\t    \"tables\": [\n149\t      {\n150\t        \"name\": \"Table: LLM-as-Judge Variants on Gold Set\",\n151\t        \"columns\": [\n152\t          \"Configuration\",\n153\t          \"Gold Macro-F1\",\n154\t          \"F1-stag\",\n155\t          \"F1-prog\",\n156\t          \"Cost (USD)\",\n157\t          \"Latency/window\"\n158\t        ],\n159\t        \"rows\": [\n160\t          [\n161\t            \"Zero-shot\",\n162\t            \"0.6891\",\n163\t            \"0.6203\",\n164\t            \"0.7579\",\n165\t            \"$11.66†\",\n166\t            \"~2.1s\"\n167\t          ],\n168\t          [\n169\t            \"5-shot + CoT\",\n170\t            \"0.7234\",\n171\t            \"0.6712\",\n172\t            \"0.7756\",\n173\t            \"$18.92\",\n174\t            \"~3.2s\"\n175\t          ],\n176\t          [\n177\t            \"Structural GB\",\n178\t            \"0.9485\",\n179\t            \"0.9253\",\n180\t            \"0.9717\",\n181\t            \"$0\",\n182\t            \"<5ms\"\n183\t          ],\n184\t          [\n185\t            \"GRU Probe\",\n186\t            \"0.8612\",\n187\t            \"0.8034\",\n188\t            \"0.9190\",\n189\t            \"$0\",\n190\t            \"~12ms\"\n191\t          ]\n192\t        ]\n193\t      },\n194\t      {\n195\t        \"name\": \"Table: Error Analysis — LLM Few-shot on Gold\",\n196\t        \"columns\": [\n197\t          \"Error Type\",\n198\t          \"Count\",\n199\t          \"%\",\n200\t          \"Dominant Pattern\"\n201\t        ],\n202\t        \"rows\": [\n203\t          [\n204\t            \"FP (predicted stag, gold prog)\",\n205\t            \"72\",\n206\t            \"40.0%\",\n207\t            \"Repetitive debugging loops that are actually effective\"\n208\t          ],\n209\t          [\n210\t            \"FN (predicted prog, gold stag)\",\n211\t            \"108\",\n212\t            \"60.0%\",\n213\t            \"Diverse-action stagnation looking productive\"\n214\t          ]\n215\t        ]\n216\t      }\n217\t    ],\n218\t    \"figures\": [],\n219\t    \"analysis\": \"LLM-judge fewshot 的 0.723 为论文提供了 strongest possible LLM baseline。即使在 few-shot + CoT 的最优配置下，structural features 仍领先 22.5pp，probe 仍领先 13.8pp。这消除了 \\\"zero-shot baseline 太弱\\\" 的 reviewer concern。论文可以 claim：\\\"Even with optimized prompting (5-shot + CoT), LLM-as-judge achieves only 0.723 F1 on gold-validated labels, 22.5pp below structural features — the efficiency gap is fundamental, not prompt-engineering addressable.\\\" Cost comparison 更 dramatic：$18.92 for 650 windows vs $0 for structural。\\n\\n\\nBest 档中 LLM-judge fewshot 仍 ≤0.75。Few-shot + CoT 相比 zero-shot 带来 ~3.4pp 提升 是合理的：exemplars 帮助 LLM 校准 stagnation 的 threshold（尤其是理解\\\"语义多样但无效\\\" 模式），CoT 迫使 LLM 显式推理窗口内的进度而非逐步评估。但提升有限的原因：\\n(1) Stagnation 是 window-level 的集体属性——LLM 在 single-pass reading 中难以稳定 追踪 5 步之间的 goal-directed coherence，few-shot 只教了\\\"什么算停滞\\\"但没教\\\"如何 系统性地追踪 progress across steps\\\"；\\n(2) LLM 的核心盲点在于 diverse-action stagnation（agent 做了编辑、运行、读文件等 多样操作，看起来 productive 但实际没有推进 goal），这类模式即使有 exemplars 也很难 被 LLM 通过单次阅读识别——需要对比前后状态差异，而非仅读动作序列；\\n(3) CoT 增加了 token 开销 ~60%，但换来的准确率提升有限，因为 stagnation 判断的 bottleneck 不是\\\"推理不够\\\"而是\\\"信息提取不够\\\"——LLM 需要的是结构化特征（文件变化频率、 命令重复率）而非更长的推理链。\\n0.723 仍大幅低于 structural 0.948（-22.5pp）和 probe 0.861（-13.8pp），效率差距 在 best-case LLM 配置下依然显著。这验证了核心 claim：structural features 的优势 不是因为 LLM baseline 太弱，而是任务本质上更适合结构化特征提取。\\n\"\n220\t  },\n221\t  {\n222\t    \"name\": \"structural-feature-overlap-ablation\",\n223\t    \"description\": \"从 30-dim structural vector 中移除所有与 LF 逻辑直接重叠的特征（cmd_rep 相关 ~8 features + file_diff 相关 ~6 features），仅保留 ~16 个非重叠特征，在 gold set 上评估残差 F1\",\n224\t    \"results\": {\n225\t      \"total_features\": 30,\n226\t      \"removed_lf_overlap_features\": 14,\n227\t      \"remaining_non_overlap_features\": 16,\n228\t      \"removed_features_list\": [\n229\t        \"cmd_rep_ratio\",\n230\t        \"cmd_rep_max_consecutive\",\n231\t        \"cmd_rep_unique_ratio\",\n232\t        \"cmd_rep_entropy\",\n233\t        \"cmd_rep_bigram_repeat\",\n234\t        \"cmd_rep_last3_repeat\",\n235\t        \"cmd_rep_pattern_score\",\n236\t        \"cmd_rep_binary\",\n237\t        \"file_diff_ratio\",\n238\t        \"file_diff_count\",\n239\t        \"file_diff_unique_files\",\n240\t        \"file_diff_lines_changed\",\n241\t        \"file_diff_binary\",\n242\t        \"file_diff_entropy\"\n243\t      ],\n244\t      \"remaining_features_examples\": [\n245\t        \"output_length_mean\",\n246\t        \"output_length_std\",\n247\t        \"step_duration_mean\",\n248\t        \"error_rate\",\n249\t        \"unique_commands\",\n250\t        \"command_diversity\",\n251\t        \"directory_changes\",\n252\t        \"token_count_trend\",\n253\t        \"action_type_entropy\",\n254\t        \"response_length_ratio\",\n255\t        \"edit_revert_ratio\",\n256\t        \"tool_switch_rate\",\n257\t        \"semantic_similarity_mean\",\n258\t        \"output_novelty_score\",\n259\t        \"goal_mention_rate\",\n260\t        \"progress_keyword_ratio\"\n261\t      ],\n262\t      \"overlap_ablation_gold_rf_macro_f1\": 0.8821,\n263\t      \"overlap_ablation_gold_rf_f1_stag\": 0.8412,\n264\t      \"overlap_ablation_gold_rf_f1_prog\": 0.923,\n265\t      \"overlap_ablation_gold_gb_macro_f1\": 0.8903,\n266\t      \"overlap_ablation_gold_gb_f1_stag\": 0.8534,\n267\t      \"overlap_ablation_gold_gb_f1_prog\": 0.9272,\n268\t      \"residual_f1\": 0.8903,\n269\t      \"residual_f1_ci95_low\": 0.8651,\n270\t      \"residual_f1_ci95_high\": 0.9127,\n271\t      \"full_30_gold_gb_macro_f1\": 0.9485,\n272\t      \"delta_vs_full_pp\": -5.82,\n273\t      \"delta_vs_probe_pp\": 2.91,\n274\t      \"top3_remaining_importance\": [\n275\t        \"output_novelty_score\",\n276\t        \"action_type_entropy\",\n277\t        \"edit_revert_ratio\"\n278\t      ],\n279\t      \"overlap_ablation_lf_eval_macro_f1\": 0.9312\n280\t    },\n281\t    \"tables\": [\n282\t      {\n283\t        \"name\": \"Table: Overlap Ablation on Gold Set\",\n284\t        \"columns\": [\n285\t          \"Feature Set\",\n286\t          \"N features\",\n287\t          \"Gold Macro-F1\",\n288\t          \"Gold F1-stag\",\n289\t          \"Δ vs Full\"\n290\t        ],\n291\t        \"rows\": [\n292\t          [\n293\t            \"Full structural\",\n294\t            \"30\",\n295\t            \"0.9485\",\n296\t            \"0.9253\",\n297\t            \"—\"\n298\t          ],\n299\t          [\n300\t            \"Non-overlap only\",\n301\t            \"16\",\n302\t            \"0.8903\",\n303\t            \"0.8534\",\n304\t            \"-5.82pp\"\n305\t          ],\n306\t          [\n307\t            \"LF-overlap only\",\n308\t            \"14\",\n309\t            \"0.9289\",\n310\t            \"0.9051\",\n311\t            \"-1.96pp\"\n312\t          ],\n313\t          [\n314\t            \"GRU Probe (ref)\",\n315\t            \"1024-dim\",\n316\t            \"0.8612\",\n317\t            \"0.8034\",\n318\t            \"-8.73pp\"\n319\t          ]\n320\t        ]\n321\t      },\n322\t      {\n323\t        \"name\": \"Table: Top Non-Overlap Feature Importances (GB, gold-evaluated)\",\n324\t        \"columns\": [\n325\t          \"Feature\",\n326\t          \"Importance\",\n327\t          \"Interpretation\"\n328\t        ],\n329\t        \"rows\": [\n330\t          [\n331\t            \"output_novelty_score\",\n332\t            \"0.183\",\n333\t            \"Low novelty in outputs → stagnation\"\n334\t          ],\n335\t          [\n336\t            \"action_type_entropy\",\n337\t            \"0.156\",\n338\t            \"Low action diversity → stagnation\"\n339\t          ],\n340\t          [\n341\t            \"edit_revert_ratio\",\n342\t            \"0.134\",\n343\t            \"High revert rate → ineffective edits\"\n344\t          ],\n345\t          [\n346\t            \"token_count_trend\",\n347\t            \"0.098\",\n348\t            \"Declining token use → disengagement\"\n349\t          ],\n350\t          [\n351\t            \"tool_switch_rate\",\n352\t            \"0.087\",\n353\t            \"Low tool switching → stuck in one mode\"\n354\t          ]\n355\t        ]\n356\t      }\n357\t    ],\n358\t    \"figures\": [],\n359\t    \"analysis\": \"Overlap ablation 是 circularity concern 的最终解答。Reviewer 可能 argue \\\"structural F1 高仅因为 features 直接编码了 LF 规则\\\"——ablation 证明即使移除所有 LF-overlap features，残差 F1=0.89 仍然 (a) 远高于 random (0.50)，(b) 高于 probe (0.86)， (c) 在实用部署范围内。论文叙事：\\\"Even after removing all features that overlap with LF heuristics, the remaining 16 structural features achieve 0.89 F1 on gold — demonstrating that structural stagnation detection captures signal dimensions beyond what labeling functions encode.\\\" 这把 circular evaluation 从 \\\"fatal flaw\\\" 变成 \\\"well-characterized and controlled confound\\\"。\\n\\n\\nBest 档要求 overlap ablation residual F1 ≥0.85。移除 14 个与 LF 直接重叠的特征后 仍保持 0.890 的 gold F1，证明 structural signal 有独立于 LF 逻辑的信息贡献。\\n为什么残差 F1 高达 0.89：(1) 剩余 16 个特征（output novelty、action entropy、edit revert 等）捕获了 stagnation 的\\\"行为指纹\\\"——停滞窗口不仅命令重复和文件不变，还 伴随 output 长度下降、行为多样性降低、工具切换频率下降等模式；(2) 这些特征虽然 与 LF 逻辑无直接重叠，但与 stagnation 有 causal 关系——真正停滞的 agent 会在多个 维度同时表现出退化；(3) GB 的非线性组合能力让 16 个弱特征的联合预测力接近 14 个 强特征的单独预测力。\\n降幅 5.8pp 是合理的：被移除的 14 个特征直接编码了 LF 的两个核心启发式（cmd_rep 和 file_diff），它们本身就是 stagnation 的强信号。但 \\\"强信号被移除后仍有 0.89\\\" 正是关键论证——structural approach 的价值不仅在于重新发现 LF 逻辑，而在于捕获 LF 未覆盖的补充维度。\\nResidual F1 0.89 > probe gold F1 0.86 (+2.9pp) 进一步强化了 structural approach 的优势论证：即使只用非 LF-overlap 的特征，structural 仍 ≥ probe。\\n\"\n360\t  },\n361\t  {\n362\t    \"name\": \"cross-agent-instance-isolation\",\n363\t    \"description\": \"重新评估 cross-agent structural GB：确保 SWE-bench 训练集中无任何 instance 在 OH 测试集中出现（排除 shared benchmark instances 的信息泄露）\",\n364\t    \"results\": {\n365\t      \"swe_train_instances\": 344,\n366\t      \"oh_test_instances\": 3394,\n367\t      \"shared_benchmark_instances\": 0,\n368\t      \"note_on_sharing\": \"SWE-Agent 和 OpenHands 使用不同的 SWE-bench split，无 instance 共享；但此实验确认 structural features 不通过 problem-level 特征泄露\",\n369\t      \"isolation_method\": \"确保 structural feature 中无 instance-identifying 信息（如 repo name encoding、issue ID）。对 OH test 按 repo 分层评估排除 repo-level 泄露。\",\n370\t      \"gb_instance_isolated_macro_f1\": 0.9612,\n371\t      \"gb_instance_isolated_f1_stag\": 0.9403,\n372\t      \"gb_instance_isolated_f1_prog\": 0.9821,\n373\t      \"gb_seen_repos_macro_f1\": 0.9687,\n374\t      \"gb_unseen_repos_macro_f1\": 0.9534,\n375\t      \"gb_unseen_repos_delta_pp\": -1.53,\n376\t      \"gb_original_cross_agent_all\": 0.9674,\n377\t      \"delta_vs_original_pp\": -0.62,\n378\t      \"mcnemar_p_vs_original\": 0.43,\n379\t      \"bootstrap_ci95_low\": 0.9498,\n380\t      \"bootstrap_ci95_high\": 0.9719,\n381\t      \"probe_zeroshot_isolated_macro_f1\": 0.5921,\n382\t      \"structural_advantage_isolated_pp\": 36.91\n383\t    },\n384\t    \"tables\": [\n385\t      {\n386\t        \"name\": \"Table: Instance Isolation Evaluation\",\n387\t        \"columns\": [\n388\t          \"Condition\",\n389\t          \"GB Macro-F1\",\n390\t          \"F1-stag\",\n391\t          \"N windows\",\n392\t          \"Δ vs Original\"\n393\t        ],\n394\t        \"rows\": [\n395\t          [\n396\t            \"Original (all OH)\",\n397\t            \"0.9674\",\n398\t            \"0.9479\",\n399\t            \"150652\",\n400\t            \"—\"\n401\t          ],\n402\t          [\n403\t            \"Instance-isolated\",\n404\t            \"0.9612\",\n405\t            \"0.9403\",\n406\t            \"150652\",\n407\t            \"-0.62pp\"\n408\t          ],\n409\t          [\n410\t            \"— Seen repos only\",\n411\t            \"0.9687\",\n412\t            \"0.9512\",\n413\t            \"89432\",\n414\t            \"+0.13pp\"\n415\t          ],\n416\t          [\n417\t            \"— Unseen repos only\",\n418\t            \"0.9534\",\n419\t            \"0.9287\",\n420\t            \"61220\",\n421\t            \"-1.53pp\"\n422\t          ]\n423\t        ]\n424\t      },\n425\t      {\n426\t        \"name\": \"Table: Isolation Impact on All Methods\",\n427\t        \"columns\": [\n428\t          \"Method\",\n429\t          \"Original\",\n430\t          \"Isolated\",\n431\t          \"Δpp\",\n432\t          \"McNemar p\"\n433\t        ],\n434\t        \"rows\": [\n435\t          [\n436\t            \"Structural GB\",\n437\t            \"0.9674\",\n438\t            \"0.9612\",\n439\t            \"-0.62\",\n440\t            \"0.43\"\n441\t          ],\n442\t          [\n443\t            \"Probe zero-shot\",\n444\t            \"0.5984\",\n445\t            \"0.5921\",\n446\t            \"-0.63\",\n447\t            \"0.71\"\n448\t          ],\n449\t          [\n450\t            \"Advantage (struct-probe)\",\n451\t            \"+36.90pp\",\n452\t            \"+36.91pp\",\n453\t            \"+0.01\",\n454\t            \"—\"\n455\t          ]\n456\t        ]\n457\t      }\n458\t    ],\n459\t    \"figures\": [],\n460\t    \"analysis\": \"Instance isolation 实验关闭了最后一个 data leakage concern。降幅仅 0.62pp 且 统计不显著（McNemar p=0.43），证明 structural GB 0.967 的 cross-agent 性能是 genuine transfer 而非 information leakage artifact。Unseen repos 上仅降 1.5pp 更进一步：即使 agent 面对全新代码库，structural stagnation detection 仍然有效。 论文可以 claim：\\\"Cross-agent transfer is robust to instance isolation (Δ=-0.62pp, p=0.43), confirming that structural features capture agent behavioral patterns independent of the specific problem being solved.\\\" 与 probe 的对比在 isolation 条件下几乎完全不变（36.9pp），这是最干净的 dominance evidence。\\n\\nBest 档要求 instance isolation 后 GB ≥0.95。预测 0.961 的理由：\\n(1) SWE-Agent 和 OpenHands 本身处理不同的 SWE-bench instances（不同 split）， 所以 instance-level 信息泄露的风险本来就很低。Structural features（cmd_rep_ratio、 file_diff_count 等）是 agent 行为特征，不编码 problem identity——一个 agent 在 处理任何 bug 时的停滞行为模式是相似的（重复命令、文件不变、输出不变），与具体 修什么 bug 无关。\\n(2) 轻微降幅 0.62pp 来自 repo-level 的 minor distribution shift：某些 repo 的 代码结构可能导致 agent 行为模式略有不同（如大型 monorepo vs 小型 library）， 但效应极小因为 structural features 在 abstraction level 上足够高——它们度量的是 行为模式（重复/变化/趋势）而非内容。\\n(3) Seen vs unseen repos 差距仅 1.5pp，证明 structural features 的跨域迁移不依赖 repo familiarity。这与 structural features 的设计一致：它们度量的是 agent 行为 的 meta-patterns（是否在重复、是否在变化），完全独立于具体代码库。\\n(4) Probe 在 isolation 条件下几乎不变（0.592 vs 0.598），因为 probe 的 zero-shot failure 是 domain shift 问题而非泄露问题。Structural advantage 在 isolation 后 从 36.9pp 变为 36.9pp（几乎不变），进一步证明优势是真实的。\\n\"\n461\t  }\n462\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4878f985-92ce-465a-a74c-cd1ddc7246e7","uuid":"c2fd40d8-5517-4e68-a251-4e1259c3aa54","timestamp":"2026-05-15T02:09:59.389Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513/projects/agent_progress_probe/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T015115/best/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"gold-set\",\n    \"description\": \"650 窗口人工标注（3 annotators, majority vote），评估所有方法在 ground-truth 上的真实性能\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"gold_n_windows\": 650,\n      \"annotator_count\": 3,\n      \"gold_kappa_fleiss\": 0.82,\n      \"gold_kappa_pairwise_mean\": 0.83,\n      \"gold_mv_agreement_rate\": 0.92,\n      \"gold_stag_ratio\": 0.29,\n      \"disagreement_windows\": 52,\n      \"structural_rf_gold_macro_f1\": 0.9438,\n      \"structural_rf_gold_f1_stag\": 0.9187,\n      \"structural_rf_gold_f1_prog\": 0.9689,\n      \"structural_gb_gold_macro_f1\": 0.9485,\n      \"structural_gb_gold_f1_stag\": 0.9253,\n      \"structural_gb_gold_f1_prog\": 0.9717,\n      \"probe_gold_macro_f1\": 0.8612,\n      \"probe_gold_f1_stag\": 0.8034,\n      \"probe_gold_f1_prog\": 0.919,\n      \"structural_gb_minus_probe_gold_pp\": 8.73,\n      \"llm_judge_zeroshot_gold_macro_f1\": 0.6891,\n      \"llm_judge_zeroshot_gold_f1_stag\": 0.6203,\n      \"llm_judge_zeroshot_gold_f1_prog\": 0.7579,\n      \"twv_probe_gold_macro_f1\": 0.8549,\n      \"structural_gb_vs_llm_gold_pp\": 25.94,\n      \"probe_vs_llm_gold_pp\": 17.21,\n      \"gold_disagree_mv_n\": 52,\n      \"gold_disagree_mv_probe_correct_pct\": 0.38,\n      \"gold_disagree_mv_structural_correct_pct\": 0.56,\n      \"structural_gb_gold_ci95_low\": 0.9301,\n      \"structural_gb_gold_ci95_high\": 0.9652,\n      \"probe_gold_ci95_low\": 0.8329,\n      \"probe_gold_ci95_high\": 0.8871\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Gold-Validated Method Comparison (N=650)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Method\",\n          \"Gold Macro-F1\",\n          \"Gold F1-stag\",\n          \"Gold F1-prog\",\n          \"LF-eval F1\",\n          \"Δ(Gold-LF)\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Structural GB\",\n            \"0.9485\",\n            \"0.9253\",\n            \"0.9717\",\n            \"0.9951\",\n            \"-4.66pp\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Structural RF\",\n            \"0.9438\",\n            \"0.9187\",\n            \"0.9689\",\n            \"0.9951\",\n            \"-5.13pp\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"GRU Probe (Qwen3)\",\n            \"0.8612\",\n            \"0.8034\",\n            \"0.9190\",\n            \"0.9055\",\n            \"-4.43pp\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"LLM-judge (zero-shot)\",\n            \"0.6891\",\n            \"0.6203\",\n            \"0.7579\",\n            \"0.6625\",\n            \"+2.66pp\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"TWV Probe\",\n            \"0.8549\",\n            \"0.7941\",\n            \"0.9157\",\n            \"0.9003†\",\n            \"-4.54pp\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Inter-Annotator Agreement\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Metric\",\n          \"Value\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Fleiss' κ (3 annotators)\",\n            \"0.82\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Mean pairwise Cohen's κ\",\n            \"0.83\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Gold-MV agreement rate\",\n            \"92.0%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Disagreement windows\",\n            \"52/650 (8.0%)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Gold stag prevalence\",\n            \"29.1%\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Gold validation 是论文从 'interesting but circular' 升级到 'validated practical guidance' 的关键。8.7pp structural-probe gap 在 gold 上保持，证明 zero-shot dominance 不是 circular artifact。论文可以用 gold F1 作为 headline number（0.948 vs LF-eval 的 0.995），虽然绝对值 略低但 ground-truth validated，reviewer 无法再 dismiss 为 circular。Circular evaluation concern 通过一组数据彻底关闭：(1) structural gold F1 仅降 4.7pp 说明绝大部分信号是真实的； (2) 即使在 gold-MV disagreement 的困难样本上 structural 仍优于 probe；(3) κ=0.82 证明 stagnation 本身是可靠标注的概念。\\n\\n\\nBest 档假设 Gold 标注高度验证 MV 标签质量。κ=0.82 表明 annotators 在 stagnation 判断上有 substantial agreement（SE 任务的 progress/stagnation 边界本身有主观性，但 window-level 5-step 序列给了足够上下文让标注者达成一致）。92% gold-MV agreement 意味着 MV pipeline 在绝大多数窗口上产出了正确标签——8% 的 disagreement 集中在 conf=1 的边界案例。\\nStructural features 在 gold 上的 F1 从 LF-eval 的 0.9951 降至 ~0.948，降幅 ~4.7pp， 这正是预期的：(1) structural features 部分通过 LF 输入特征逆向工程 LF 标签，失去这层 circular boost 后性能下降；(2) 但降幅很小，说明 structural features 确实捕获了真实 stagnation 信号——不仅仅是 LF 逻辑的映射。0.948 在 650 个 ground-truth 窗口上仍然是 近乎完美的检测能力。\\nProbe 在 gold 上的 F1=0.861 vs LF-eval 的 0.906 降 ~4.5pp，降幅类似。Probe 学到的 不完全是 LF 启发式，而是部分学到了真实语义信号。但 structural 仍领先 probe 8.7pp， 证明 zero-shot dominance 在 ground truth 上成立。\\nLLM-judge 在 gold 上 0.689 vs LF-eval 的 0.663 微升 2.6pp——LLM 不受 circular eval 影响（本来就是独立评估），gold 标签略偏向 LLM 的语义判断，合理。但仍远低于 structural 和 probe，效率差距在 ground truth 上得到验证。\\nGold 与 MV disagreement 的 52 个窗口中 structural 有 56% 正确率（高于 probe 的 38%）， 进一步支持 structural features 检测的是真实停滞而非仅仅拟合 LF 规则。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"llm-judge-fewshot\",\n    \"description\": \"LLM-as-judge 加入 5-shot exemplars + chain-of-thought prompting，在 gold set 650 窗口上评估\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"model\": \"claude-sonnet-4-6\",\n      \"mode\": \"5-shot + CoT\",\n      \"n_windows\": 650,\n      \"gold_macro_f1\": 0.7234,\n      \"gold_f1_stag\": 0.6712,\n      \"gold_f1_prog\": 0.7756,\n      \"gold_accuracy\": 0.7369,\n      \"gold_precision_macro\": 0.7518,\n      \"gold_recall_macro\": 0.7102,\n      \"delta_vs_zeroshot_pp\": 3.43,\n      \"structural_gb_advantage_pp\": 22.51,\n      \"probe_advantage_pp\": 13.78,\n      \"api_cost_usd\": 18.92,\n      \"total_tokens\": 4812000,\n      \"avg_latency_ms\": 3200,\n      \"stag_recall\": 0.6389,\n      \"stag_precision\": 0.7081,\n      \"common_FN_pattern\": \"diverse-action stagnation where steps look productive in isolation\",\n      \"common_FP_pattern\": \"repetitive but effective debugging loops\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: LLM-as-Judge Variants on Gold Set\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Configuration\",\n          \"Gold Macro-F1\",\n          \"F1-stag\",\n          \"F1-prog\",\n          \"Cost (USD)\",\n          \"Latency/window\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Zero-shot\",\n            \"0.6891\",\n            \"0.6203\",\n            \"0.7579\",\n            \"$11.66†\",\n            \"~2.1s\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"5-shot + CoT\",\n            \"0.7234\",\n            \"0.6712\",\n            \"0.7756\",\n            \"$18.92\",\n            \"~3.2s\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Structural GB\",\n            \"0.9485\",\n            \"0.9253\",\n            \"0.9717\",\n            \"$0\",\n            \"<5ms\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"GRU Probe\",\n            \"0.8612\",\n            \"0.8034\",\n            \"0.9190\",\n            \"$0\",\n            \"~12ms\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Error Analysis — LLM Few-shot on Gold\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Error Type\",\n          \"Count\",\n          \"%\",\n          \"Dominant Pattern\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"FP (predicted stag, gold prog)\",\n            \"72\",\n            \"40.0%\",\n            \"Repetitive debugging loops that are actually effective\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"FN (predicted prog, gold stag)\",\n            \"108\",\n            \"60.0%\",\n            \"Diverse-action stagnation looking productive\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"LLM-judge fewshot 的 0.723 为论文提供了 strongest possible LLM baseline。即使在 few-shot + CoT 的最优配置下，structural features 仍领先 22.5pp，probe 仍领先 13.8pp。这消除了 \\\"zero-shot baseline 太弱\\\" 的 reviewer concern。论文可以 claim：\\\"Even with optimized prompting (5-shot + CoT), LLM-as-judge achieves only 0.723 F1 on gold-validated labels, 22.5pp below structural features — the efficiency gap is fundamental, not prompt-engineering addressable.\\\" Cost comparison 更 dramatic：$18.92 for 650 windows vs $0 for structural。\\n\\n\\nBest 档中 LLM-judge fewshot 仍 ≤0.75。Few-shot + CoT 相比 zero-shot 带来 ~3.4pp 提升 是合理的：exemplars 帮助 LLM 校准 stagnation 的 threshold（尤其是理解\\\"语义多样但无效\\\" 模式），CoT 迫使 LLM 显式推理窗口内的进度而非逐步评估。但提升有限的原因：\\n(1) Stagnation 是 window-level 的集体属性——LLM 在 single-pass reading 中难以稳定 追踪 5 步之间的 goal-directed coherence，few-shot 只教了\\\"什么算停滞\\\"但没教\\\"如何 系统性地追踪 progress across steps\\\"；\\n(2) LLM 的核心盲点在于 diverse-action stagnation（agent 做了编辑、运行、读文件等 多样操作，看起来 productive 但实际没有推进 goal），这类模式即使有 exemplars 也很难 被 LLM 通过单次阅读识别——需要对比前后状态差异，而非仅读动作序列；\\n(3) CoT 增加了 token 开销 ~60%，但换来的准确率提升有限，因为 stagnation 判断的 bottleneck 不是\\\"推理不够\\\"而是\\\"信息提取不够\\\"——LLM 需要的是结构化特征（文件变化频率、 命令重复率）而非更长的推理链。\\n0.723 仍大幅低于 structural 0.948（-22.5pp）和 probe 0.861（-13.8pp），效率差距 在 best-case LLM 配置下依然显著。这验证了核心 claim：structural features 的优势 不是因为 LLM baseline 太弱，而是任务本质上更适合结构化特征提取。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"structural-feature-overlap-ablation\",\n    \"description\": \"从 30-dim structural vector 中移除所有与 LF 逻辑直接重叠的特征（cmd_rep 相关 ~8 features + file_diff 相关 ~6 features），仅保留 ~16 个非重叠特征，在 gold set 上评估残差 F1\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"total_features\": 30,\n      \"removed_lf_overlap_features\": 14,\n      \"remaining_non_overlap_features\": 16,\n      \"removed_features_list\": [\n        \"cmd_rep_ratio\",\n        \"cmd_rep_max_consecutive\",\n        \"cmd_rep_unique_ratio\",\n        \"cmd_rep_entropy\",\n        \"cmd_rep_bigram_repeat\",\n        \"cmd_rep_last3_repeat\",\n        \"cmd_rep_pattern_score\",\n        \"cmd_rep_binary\",\n        \"file_diff_ratio\",\n        \"file_diff_count\",\n        \"file_diff_unique_files\",\n        \"file_diff_lines_changed\",\n        \"file_diff_binary\",\n        \"file_diff_entropy\"\n      ],\n      \"remaining_features_examples\": [\n        \"output_length_mean\",\n        \"output_length_std\",\n        \"step_duration_mean\",\n        \"error_rate\",\n        \"unique_commands\",\n        \"command_diversity\",\n        \"directory_changes\",\n        \"token_count_trend\",\n        \"action_type_entropy\",\n        \"response_length_ratio\",\n        \"edit_revert_ratio\",\n        \"tool_switch_rate\",\n        \"semantic_similarity_mean\",\n        \"output_novelty_score\",\n        \"goal_mention_rate\",\n        \"progress_keyword_ratio\"\n      ],\n      \"overlap_ablation_gold_rf_macro_f1\": 0.8821,\n      \"overlap_ablation_gold_rf_f1_stag\": 0.8412,\n      \"overlap_ablation_gold_rf_f1_prog\": 0.923,\n      \"overlap_ablation_gold_gb_macro_f1\": 0.8903,\n      \"overlap_ablation_gold_gb_f1_stag\": 0.8534,\n      \"overlap_ablation_gold_gb_f1_prog\": 0.9272,\n      \"residual_f1\": 0.8903,\n      \"residual_f1_ci95_low\": 0.8651,\n      \"residual_f1_ci95_high\": 0.9127,\n      \"full_30_gold_gb_macro_f1\": 0.9485,\n      \"delta_vs_full_pp\": -5.82,\n      \"delta_vs_probe_pp\": 2.91,\n      \"top3_remaining_importance\": [\n        \"output_novelty_score\",\n        \"action_type_entropy\",\n        \"edit_revert_ratio\"\n      ],\n      \"overlap_ablation_lf_eval_macro_f1\": 0.9312\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Overlap Ablation on Gold Set\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Feature Set\",\n          \"N features\",\n          \"Gold Macro-F1\",\n          \"Gold F1-stag\",\n          \"Δ vs Full\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Full structural\",\n            \"30\",\n            \"0.9485\",\n            \"0.9253\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Non-overlap only\",\n            \"16\",\n            \"0.8903\",\n            \"0.8534\",\n            \"-5.82pp\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"LF-overlap only\",\n            \"14\",\n            \"0.9289\",\n            \"0.9051\",\n            \"-1.96pp\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"GRU Probe (ref)\",\n            \"1024-dim\",\n            \"0.8612\",\n            \"0.8034\",\n            \"-8.73pp\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Top Non-Overlap Feature Importances (GB, gold-evaluated)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Feature\",\n          \"Importance\",\n          \"Interpretation\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"output_novelty_score\",\n            \"0.183\",\n            \"Low novelty in outputs → stagnation\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"action_type_entropy\",\n            \"0.156\",\n            \"Low action diversity → stagnation\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"edit_revert_ratio\",\n            \"0.134\",\n            \"High revert rate → ineffective edits\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"token_count_trend\",\n            \"0.098\",\n            \"Declining token use → disengagement\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"tool_switch_rate\",\n            \"0.087\",\n            \"Low tool switching → stuck in one mode\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Overlap ablation 是 circularity concern 的最终解答。Reviewer 可能 argue \\\"structural F1 高仅因为 features 直接编码了 LF 规则\\\"——ablation 证明即使移除所有 LF-overlap features，残差 F1=0.89 仍然 (a) 远高于 random (0.50)，(b) 高于 probe (0.86)， (c) 在实用部署范围内。论文叙事：\\\"Even after removing all features that overlap with LF heuristics, the remaining 16 structural features achieve 0.89 F1 on gold — demonstrating that structural stagnation detection captures signal dimensions beyond what labeling functions encode.\\\" 这把 circular evaluation 从 \\\"fatal flaw\\\" 变成 \\\"well-characterized and controlled confound\\\"。\\n\\n\\nBest 档要求 overlap ablation residual F1 ≥0.85。移除 14 个与 LF 直接重叠的特征后 仍保持 0.890 的 gold F1，证明 structural signal 有独立于 LF 逻辑的信息贡献。\\n为什么残差 F1 高达 0.89：(1) 剩余 16 个特征（output novelty、action entropy、edit revert 等）捕获了 stagnation 的\\\"行为指纹\\\"——停滞窗口不仅命令重复和文件不变，还 伴随 output 长度下降、行为多样性降低、工具切换频率下降等模式；(2) 这些特征虽然 与 LF 逻辑无直接重叠，但与 stagnation 有 causal 关系——真正停滞的 agent 会在多个 维度同时表现出退化；(3) GB 的非线性组合能力让 16 个弱特征的联合预测力接近 14 个 强特征的单独预测力。\\n降幅 5.8pp 是合理的：被移除的 14 个特征直接编码了 LF 的两个核心启发式（cmd_rep 和 file_diff），它们本身就是 stagnation 的强信号。但 \\\"强信号被移除后仍有 0.89\\\" 正是关键论证——structural approach 的价值不仅在于重新发现 LF 逻辑，而在于捕获 LF 未覆盖的补充维度。\\nResidual F1 0.89 > probe gold F1 0.86 (+2.9pp) 进一步强化了 structural approach 的优势论证：即使只用非 LF-overlap 的特征，structural 仍 ≥ probe。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"cross-agent-instance-isolation\",\n    \"description\": \"重新评估 cross-agent structural GB：确保 SWE-bench 训练集中无任何 instance 在 OH 测试集中出现（排除 shared benchmark instances 的信息泄露）\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"swe_train_instances\": 344,\n      \"oh_test_instances\": 3394,\n      \"shared_benchmark_instances\": 0,\n      \"note_on_sharing\": \"SWE-Agent 和 OpenHands 使用不同的 SWE-bench split，无 instance 共享；但此实验确认 structural features 不通过 problem-level 特征泄露\",\n      \"isolation_method\": \"确保 structural feature 中无 instance-identifying 信息（如 repo name encoding、issue ID）。对 OH test 按 repo 分层评估排除 repo-level 泄露。\",\n      \"gb_instance_isolated_macro_f1\": 0.9612,\n      \"gb_instance_isolated_f1_stag\": 0.9403,\n      \"gb_instance_isolated_f1_prog\": 0.9821,\n      \"gb_seen_repos_macro_f1\": 0.9687,\n      \"gb_unseen_repos_macro_f1\": 0.9534,\n      \"gb_unseen_repos_delta_pp\": -1.53,\n      \"gb_original_cross_agent_all\": 0.9674,\n      \"delta_vs_original_pp\": -0.62,\n      \"mcnemar_p_vs_original\": 0.43,\n      \"bootstrap_ci95_low\": 0.9498,\n      \"bootstrap_ci95_high\": 0.9719,\n      \"probe_zeroshot_isolated_macro_f1\": 0.5921,\n      \"structural_advantage_isolated_pp\": 36.91\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Instance Isolation Evaluation\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Condition\",\n          \"GB Macro-F1\",\n          \"F1-stag\",\n          \"N windows\",\n          \"Δ vs Original\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Original (all OH)\",\n            \"0.9674\",\n            \"0.9479\",\n            \"150652\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Instance-isolated\",\n            \"0.9612\",\n            \"0.9403\",\n            \"150652\",\n            \"-0.62pp\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"— Seen repos only\",\n            \"0.9687\",\n            \"0.9512\",\n            \"89432\",\n            \"+0.13pp\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"— Unseen repos only\",\n            \"0.9534\",\n            \"0.9287\",\n            \"61220\",\n            \"-1.53pp\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Isolation Impact on All Methods\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Method\",\n          \"Original\",\n          \"Isolated\",\n          \"Δpp\",\n          \"McNemar p\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Structural GB\",\n            \"0.9674\",\n            \"0.9612\",\n            \"-0.62\",\n            \"0.43\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Probe zero-shot\",\n            \"0.5984\",\n            \"0.5921\",\n            \"-0.63\",\n            \"0.71\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Advantage (struct-probe)\",\n            \"+36.90pp\",\n            \"+36.91pp\",\n            \"+0.01\",\n            \"—\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Instance isolation 实验关闭了最后一个 data leakage concern。降幅仅 0.62pp 且 统计不显著（McNemar p=0.43），证明 structural GB 0.967 的 cross-agent 性能是 genuine transfer 而非 information leakage artifact。Unseen repos 上仅降 1.5pp 更进一步：即使 agent 面对全新代码库，structural stagnation detection 仍然有效。 论文可以 claim：\\\"Cross-agent transfer is robust to instance isolation (Δ=-0.62pp, p=0.43), confirming that structural features capture agent behavioral patterns independent of the specific problem being solved.\\\" 与 probe 的对比在 isolation 条件下几乎完全不变（36.9pp），这是最干净的 dominance evidence。\\n\\nBest 档要求 instance isolation 后 GB ≥0.95。预测 0.961 的理由：\\n(1) SWE-Agent 和 OpenHands 本身处理不同的 SWE-bench instances（不同 split）， 所以 instance-level 信息泄露的风险本来就很低。Structural features（cmd_rep_ratio、 file_diff_count 等）是 agent 行为特征，不编码 problem identity——一个 agent 在 处理任何 bug 时的停滞行为模式是相似的（重复命令、文件不变、输出不变），与具体 修什么 bug 无关。\\n(2) 轻微降幅 0.62pp 来自 repo-level 的 minor distribution shift：某些 repo 的 代码结构可能导致 agent 行为模式略有不同（如大型 monorepo vs 小型 library）， 但效应极小因为 structural features 在 abstraction level 上足够高——它们度量的是 行为模式（重复/变化/趋势）而非内容。\\n(3) Seen vs unseen repos 差距仅 1.5pp，证明 structural features 的跨域迁移不依赖 repo familiarity。这与 structural features 的设计一致：它们度量的是 agent 行为 的 meta-patterns（是否在重复、是否在变化），完全独立于具体代码库。\\n(4) Probe 在 isolation 条件下几乎不变（0.592 vs 0.598），因为 probe 的 zero-shot failure 是 domain shift 问题而非泄露问题。Structural advantage 在 isolation 后 从 36.9pp 变为 36.9pp（几乎不变），进一步证明优势是真实的。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":462,"startLine":1,"totalLines":462}}}
